<p>The gateway terminates TLS and applies per-tenant rate limits. Everything
downstream of the Order Service is asynchronous.</p>
<h2 id="md-heading-2">2. Order placement sequence</h2>
<p>The critical path involves four services. Payment authorization is the only
synchronous external call.</p>
<figure class="mermaid-figure" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Mermaid diagram">
<div class="mermaid-stage"><div class="mermaid">
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    participant O as OrderSvc
    participant P as PaymentSvc
    participant Q as Queue
    C-&gt;&gt;G: POST /orders
    G-&gt;&gt;O: forward (traced)
    O-&gt;&gt;P: authorize(card, amount)
    P--&gt;&gt;O: auth token
    O-&gt;&gt;Q: enqueue(fulfilment)
    O--&gt;&gt;G: 201 Created
    G--&gt;&gt;C: order id + ETA
    Note over O,P: p99 here is 180 ms —&lt;br/&gt;the platform's dominant latency

</div></div>
