<h2 id="md-heading-4">4. Order lifecycle</h2>
<p>Status transitions are strictly forward except for the cancellation edges.</p>
<figure class="mermaid-figure" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Mermaid diagram">
<div class="mermaid-stage"><div class="mermaid">
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --&gt; Draft
    Draft --&gt; Placed: submit
    Placed --&gt; Paid: payment ok
    Placed --&gt; Cancelled: payment failed
    Paid --&gt; Fulfilling: picked up
    Fulfilling --&gt; Shipped: handed to carrier
    Fulfilling --&gt; Cancelled: out of stock
    Shipped --&gt; Delivered
    Delivered --&gt; [*]
    Cancelled --&gt; [*]

</div></div>
